{"title": "Automaton", "pageid": 42876, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Automaton", "categories": ["Creatures", "Races", "Non-playable races", "Constructs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bernard_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Bernard_Model.png/300px-Bernard_Model.png.webp, /w/images/9/92/Bernard_Model.png 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Bernard_Model.png/300px-Bernard_Model.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"598\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Bernard_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  An Automaton in Baldur's Gate 3  </div></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Automatons</b> are non-playable <a href=\"/wiki/Construct\" title=\"Construct\">construct</a> creatures in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. They look like mechanical creatures, often with facial features derived from their creator or creature they were trying to emulate. \n</p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 100px; height: 100px; clip-path: xywh(0 0 100% 100% round 15%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Portrait_Automaton.png/100px-Portrait_Automaton.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Portrait_Automaton.png/150px-Portrait_Automaton.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9e/Portrait_Automaton.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Portrait_Automaton.png/100px-Portrait_Automaton.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/9e/Portrait_Automaton.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Once a blueprint, now an indication of modern technology, this machine can only ever be a facsimile of a real person.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— In-game racial description</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About_automatons\">About automatons</span></h2>\n<p>Automatons are simple constructs, usually built to perform manual labour or to act as servants or butlers. They are powered by reserves of magical energy that can last for hundreds of years, and they are often found as heirlooms of noble houses or royalty.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Racial_features\">Racial features</span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Speed_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png/38px-Creature_Speed_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Creature Speed Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Speed_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Base Racial Speed</dt>\n<dd>9m / 30ft</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/38px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Creature Size Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Size</dt>\n<dd>Medium</dd></dl>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack:_Static_Discharge\" title=\"Multiattack: Static Discharge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Generic_Multiattack_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Multiattack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Generic_Multiattack_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Multiattack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Generic_Multiattack_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Multiattack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack: Static Discharge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Generic_Multiattack_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Multiattack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Generic_Multiattack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack:_Static_Discharge\" title=\"Multiattack: Static Discharge\">Multiattack: Static Discharge</a></span></dt><dd>Benard can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Bernard)\" title=\"Multiattack (Bernard)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/38px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/50px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Bernard)\" title=\"Multiattack (Bernard)\">Multiattack</a> while under the effects of his <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Static_Discharge_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Static Discharge Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Static Discharge Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Static_Discharge_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Static Discharge Aura (Condition)\">Static Discharge Aura</a>.</dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_automaton_characters\">Known automaton characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bernard\" title=\"Bernard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png/30px-Portrait_Bernard.png.webp, /w/images/